  <entry>
    <id>https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/156.0/releasenotes/</id>
    <title type="html">Thunderbird 156.0</title>
    <author>
      <name>Thunderbird</name>
      <uri>https://www.thunderbird.net</uri>
    </author>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/156.0/releasenotes/"/>
    <updated>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <published>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</published>

    <content type="html"><![CDATA[
      

  
  

  
    

    
      
        
        

        
          <h3>What’s New</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>OpenPGP key properties can print debug information to the Error Console</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>External browser login flow enabled for Yandex</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Custom OAuth support for issuer ID and client secret field for IMAP and POP3</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Custom OAuth support for POP3</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Enterprise policy <code>DisableUpdateSettings</code> prevents users from changing update settings</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Enterprise policy <code>DisableDataCollectionSettings</code> prevents users from changing data collection setting</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Enterprise policy <code>DisableMessageForwardingFilters</code> prevents message filters from automatically forwarding messages</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Changed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Preference <code>mail.offer_experimental_features</code> renamed to <code>mail.experimental_features_settings.enabled</code></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Thundermail built-in add-on updated to v2.0.11</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Fixed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Detached attachment links were truncated when folder path contained <code>&amp;</code></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Opening a PDF attachment in a tab displayed empty tab</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>POP3 folders with names over 55 characters could become duplicated after upgrading</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Folders with invalid filename characters could show hashed names if cache was lost</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Save All, Detach All, and Delete All failed after deleting one attachment</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Renaming folders could reset folder settings</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Subscribing an IMAP folder and subfolder together failed to subscribe the subfolder</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Some newly fetched POP messages were not marked with new star after startup</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Sorting after deleting the only child message removed the parent from view</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>OpenPGP signing failed with external GnuPG when the primary key could not sign</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Remote content could load in encrypted messages opened from files</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Sent message with expired S/MIME certificate wrongly showed untrusted CA warning</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>PDF attachments from compose windows could wrongly be detected as HTML</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Saving unconfirmed recipients could create invalid address pills with <code>&gt;&gt;</code></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
